{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_014_02_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:e8e94daa4dfb18642f4f6b686f43887aaee720d8beff08f3b58c617f3ce2b52f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_d:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a310b85f65bc47d65135217fabc727b9aed630da147dbd9aa96c0e178e4cc656",
      "text": "那个，315 Production的位置是……\n顺着这条路直走，到了尽头……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_d:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad118278f9f45660478c78d4b11a1d6fcb8d1000e0feb3342c51062111c71d93",
      "text": "真是的。石川社长总是这么突如其来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_d:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:625a2d13fb476b6e327a91c29bc7d195ee53aec7ca2e6fee58c424d47d3ea728",
      "text": "居然说什么“想要积累作为男性偶像的实力，\n就去315 Production修行吧！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_d:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6515dcb41880ad8296ecf9c33a025985944ccf700539794f7c28ae30cbb8526",
      "text": "不过，多亏了这样我才能向梦想迈进。\n接下来也要加油了！……嗯？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_d:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0db151d21c65ed08e830cc3ba727b52e6576fe6d57104784be63422b8c6af087",
      "text": "请、请住手！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_d:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f554544b0ace52c6e70c6859be7d66c4f5916c2bdd04db2be709bdc1a953783",
      "text": "有什么关系嘛，陪我们玩玩呗！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_d:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1eb32ae90747ff4f0d4d361a4994746555288d937b474fa26297fe1ea7e23f59",
      "text": "那是……有女孩子被纠缠了！？糟糕了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_d:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:81232a91287f6cfd1584b02fbd80b99ffe56426fa4f2382b065e3b8a2fc9171f",
      "text": "住手！她明明很不愿意啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_d:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0309ef07ae82c59dd7ebefccd8fd24fb21a2b7786d66c7f2bea885ef3f8532aa",
      "text": "搞什么啊，别来碍事……等等，\n哎呀……这个女孩子也很可爱嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_d:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ffac45a0d6c10a633299b7b24df25a4256811b76ef9c0052d108dc3e3d7574c3",
      "text": "和我们一起去玩嘛。\n来，跟我们走吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_d:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5620373873b20437adbc1b6939cdb83dcd03779b9632e98f756f4aeb88f71ea6",
      "text": "我、我是男孩子，我才不去！\n你的手，快放……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_d:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c7b5b52b617eff234d52d2858e15eb6ae5b26f420d819f98b31bc5c403ea333",
      "text": "强行带走不愿意的姑娘们，\n可不是什么值得夸奖的行为啊～",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
